flowchart TD
  I[Inbox question] --> P[Research Plan]
  P -->|Ask / read-only| E[Evidence query]
  P -->|Plan approved| X[Execute bounded steps]
  E --> F{Fresh + sufficient?}
  F -- no --> H[HOLD: show gap and recovery action]
  H --> E
  F -- yes --> C[Compare / Claim Graph]
  C --> B[Blueprint / ADR / risks]
  B --> R[Human review]
  R -->|accept| O[Focus / action / export]
  R -->|return| C
  O --> Z[Receipt + digest + archive]
